.TH CF 1 "September 2026" "cf-cli v1.1.2" "Cloudflare CLI Manual"
.SH NAME
cf.1 \- Cloudflare CLI wrapping the entire Cloudflare REST API
.PP
Welcome to the comprehensive documentation for \fB\fB@agileguy/cf-cli\fR\fR (\fBcf\fR), a zero-dependency, fully featured CLI wrapping the entire Cloudflare REST API.
.PP
.PP
